<div>
    <p><code>code</code> identifies which driver handles a method (matched by <code>PaymentManager::driver()</code> — currently <code>liqpay</code>, <code>mono_installment</code>, <code>privat_installment</code>); any other code (e.g. <code>cash_on_delivery</code>, <code>bank_transfer</code>) is an offline method that never reaches a driver. <code>provider</code> is a vendor label used for admin filtering; <code>type</code> is the checkout-grouping category <code>PaymentMethodService::getPaymentMethods()</code> groups by.</p>
    <p>Gateway credentials live in <code>config/payment.php</code> (env: <code>LIQPAY_PUBLIC</code>/<code>LIQPAY_PRIVATE</code>, <code>MONOBANK_STORE_ID</code>/<code>MONOBANK_SECRET</code>/<code>MONOBANK_URL</code>, <code>PRIVAT_STORE_ID</code>/<code>PRIVAT_PASSWORD</code>/<code>PRIVAT_API_URL</code>) — defaults are each gateway's public sandbox credentials.</p>
    <p>Routes: <code>GET /payment/{orderId}</code> (redirect to the gateway), <code>POST /payment/callback/{provider}</code> (gateway webhook, no CSRF), <code>GET /payment/result/{orderId}</code> (return page). <code>php artisan payments:check-installments</code> polls pending installment orders from the last 25 minutes — schedule it (e.g. every few minutes) if installment methods are enabled; it isn't scheduled automatically.</p>
</div>
